1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:02,220
NASA plans to crash the Space Station

2
00:00:02,280 --> 00:00:04,540
into the ocean around 2031.

3
00:00:05,220 --> 00:00:06,940
It spans a hundred and nine metres,

4
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,080
like a football field.

5
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,380
Most hardware vaporises.

6
00:00:10,980 --> 00:00:12,940
A deorbit craft steers the rest

7
00:00:12,980 --> 00:00:14,680
into the empty South Pacific.

8
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:18,320
Look up and watch it cross the sky, because…
